/StructElem>>endobj18376 0 obj<</K[3 18645 0 R 5]/P 18332 0 R/Pg 911 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj18377 0 obj<</K 7/P 18332 0 R/Pg 911 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18378 0 obj<</K[8 18635 0 R 10 18636 0 R 12 18637 0 R 14 18638 0 R 16 18639 0 R 18]/P 18332 0 R/Pg 911 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18379 0 obj<</A 18634 0 R/Alt(The image consists of three sections showing motors. \(a\) The input image displays a motor on a table with a red object in the background. \(b\) A series of six images generated from the prompt "An image of a motor," showing different angles and lighting\ of a motor. \(c\) A series of six images generated from the prompt "An image of a motor with a rusty surface," depicting motors with varying degrees of rust and wear.)/K 2/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj18380 0 obj<</K[3 18632 0 R 5]/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj18381 0 obj<</K[18630 0 R 8]/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18382 0 obj<</K 10/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj18383 0 obj<</K 11/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18384 0 obj<</K 13/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18385 0 obj<</K 15/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18386 0 obj<</K[18387 0 R 18388 0 R 18389 0 R 18390 0 R 18391 0 R 18392 0 R 18393 0 R 18394 0 R 18395 0 R 18396 0 R 18397 0 R 18398 0 R 18399 0 R 18400 0 R 18401 0 R 18402 0 R 18403 0 R 18404 0 R 18405 0 R 18406 0 R 18407 0 R 18408 0 R 18409 0 R 18410 0 R 18411 0 R 18412 0 R 18413 0 R 18414 0 R 18415 0 R 18416 0 R 18417 0 R 18418 0 R 18419 0 R 18420 0 R 18421 0 R 18422 0 R 18423 0 R 18424 0 R 18425 0 R 18426 0 R 18427 0 R 18428 0 R 18429 0 R 18430 0 R 18431 0 R 18432 0 R 18433 0 R 18434 0 R 18435 0 R 18436 0 R 18437 0 R 18438 0 R 18439 0 R 18440 0 R 18441 0 R 18442 0 R 18443 0 R 18444 0 R]/P 18332 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj18387 0 obj<</K[18627 0 R 18628 0 R]/P 18386 0 R/S/